# The propensive libraries this repository builds against: one per line, tab-separated, as
# `repository  version  [commit]`. A version `X.Y.Z` is a GitHub Release; `X.Y.Z-<12 hex>` is a
# snapshot of an unreleased build, published by `make snapshot` in that repository (the commit
# column says which commit), and `make release` here refuses to run while one is pinned. The
# build reads this file (`deps` in build.mill); `make sync-deps` and CI install what it names.
# See propensive/.github for the whole flow.
#
# Lira depends on Soundness alone — and specifically on reliquary, which is the language-blind
# implementation of the LIRA format this repository specifies; the `lira` command here is only its
# front end. It is NOT a Pyrocosm application: nothing compiles against pyrocosm-model or its
# frontends, and nothing should. The flair plugin and fume, which this repository merely runs, are
# tools rather than dependencies: see etc/tools.
